  "description": "EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY TO: rentals@herterichauctioneers.ie\nFOR A SWIFTER RESPONSE PLEASE EMAIL REFERENCES\n\nHerterich Auctioneers are delighted to present this excellent three-bedroom semi-detached home to the rental market. \n\nIdeally located in the popular Knightswood development, the property enjoys direct access to the Waterford Ring Road, providing excellent connectivity to Waterford City and surrounding areas. University Hospital Waterford is also within a short walking distance, while a host of local shops, schools and amenities are all close by.\n\nBoasting an impressive A2 BER rating, this home offers modern, energy-efficient living in a well-established and highly sought-after residential location. The property offers bright and comfortable accommodation throughout, with off-street parking and a private rear garden.\n\nAccommodation includes: Sitting Room, Open plan Kitchen Diner, Utility and WC Downstairs, 3-Bedrooms with one En-suite and Family Bathroom upstairs ",
